1
00:00:00,422 --> 00:00:02,322
(Leonard:)Two can play this game. Penny...

2
00:00:02,524 --> 00:00:04,284
- Get up.
- All right.

3
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:14,733
Nice that the people
who are Ionely on Valentine's Day...

4
00:00:14,936 --> 00:00:16,836
(Raj:)...can come here tonight
and be together.

5
00:00:17,038 --> 00:00:19,338
(Stuart:)Yeah, I'm really looking forward to it.

6
00:00:19,541 --> 00:00:22,071
(Stuart:)In fact, there's no place
I'd rather be than here.

7
00:00:22,277 --> 00:00:25,437
- Except on a date with anybody.
- Literally anybody.

8
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:29,415
(Raj:)You and I have so much fun hanging out.

9
00:00:29,618 --> 00:00:32,448
(Raj:)If you were a girl,
all of our problems would be solved.

10
00:00:36,358 --> 00:00:37,378
(Leonard:)What?

11
00:00:37,959 --> 00:00:42,619
(Raj:)Think about it. We'd hang out,
we'd read comic books, we'd see movies.

12
00:00:42,864 --> 00:00:44,894
(Raj:)It'd be like the best relationship ever.

13
00:00:45,467 --> 00:00:48,127
- It does sound nice.
- Then I'd take you home...

14
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:52,900
(Raj:)...slip off your little, black dress
and pile-drive you into oblivion.

15
00:00:55,777 --> 00:00:59,027
(Leonard:)What?

